---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { mascotSvg } from '../lib/mascot';
---
<Base title="Ma collection" active="collection" description="Ta collection de cartes, stockée dans ton navigateur.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Mon classeur</p>
      <h1>Ma <span class="holo-text">collection</span></h1>
      <p class="muted">Tes cartes scannées ou gagnées au Défi. Elles restent dans ce navigateur : pense à les sauvegarder depuis l'onglet Compte.</p>
      <div class="stats">
        <div class="stat stat-main">
          <span class="stat-label">Valeur estimée</span>
          <span class="stat-value holo-text" id="total">—</span>
          <span class="stat-sub" id="total-detail"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label">Cartes</span>
          <span class="stat-value" id="count">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label">Différentes</span>
          <span class="stat-value" id="unique">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <span class="stat-label">Rares et +</span>
          <span class="stat-value" id="rares">0</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a class="gem" id="gem" hidden>
      <span class="gem-label">Ta pépite</span>
      <div class="gem-card" id="gem-card"></div>
      <span class="gem-name" id="gem-name"></span>
      <span class="gem-value" id="gem-value"></span>
    </a>
  </section>

  <p id="storage-warning" class="notice" hidden>
    Ton navigateur bloque le stockage (navigation privée ?) : la collection sera perdue en fermant l'onglet. Exporte-la avant de partir.
  </p>

  <div class="toolbar" id="toolbar" hidden>
    <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="Filtrer par rareté">
      <button type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Toutes</button>
      <button type="button" data-filter="rare" aria-pressed="false">Rares et +</button>
      <button type="button" data-filter="ultra" aria-pressed="false">Ultra rares</button>
      <button type="button" data-filter="secret" aria-pressed="false">Secrètes</button>
    </div>
    <div class="toolbar-right">
      <div class="view-tg" role="group" aria-label="Affichage">
        <button type="button" data-view="grid" aria-pressed="true">Grille</button>
        <button type="button" data-view="book" aria-pressed="false">Classeur</button>
      </div>
      <label class="sr-only" for="find">Chercher dans ma collection</label>
      <input id="find" type="search" placeholder="Chercher…" autocomplete="off" />
      <label class="sr-only" for="sort">Trier</label>
      <select id="sort">
        <option value="value">Plus chères</option>
        <option value="recent">Plus récentes</option>
        <option value="name">Nom A → Z</option>
        <option value="rarity">Rareté</option>
      </select>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="sets-goal" id="sets-goal" hidden aria-labelledby="sg-h">
    <div class="sg-head">
      <h2 id="sg-h">Mes extensions</h2>
      <p class="muted small">Cartes différentes de chaque extension dans ton classeur, sur le nombre de cartes de la série (hors cartes secrètes, comptées à part).</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="sg-list" id="sg-list"></ul>
    <button type="button" class="link-btn" id="sg-more" hidden>Voir toutes mes extensions</button>
  </section>

  <div id="binder" class="binder"></div>
  <section class="book" id="book" hidden aria-label="Classeur à feuilleter" tabindex="-1">
    <div class="book-spread" id="book-spread"></div>
    <div class="book-nav">
      <button type="button" class="btn" id="book-prev" aria-label="Pages précédentes">‹ Précédente</button>
      <span class="book-pg" id="book-pg" aria-live="polite"></span>
      <button type="button" class="btn" id="book-next" aria-label="Pages suivantes">Suivante ›</button>
    </div>
    <p class="muted small book-help">Flèches du clavier ou glisse du doigt pour tourner les pages. Les poches vides attendent tes prochaines cartes.</p>
  </section>
  <p id="no-match" class="muted" hidden>Aucune carte ne correspond à ce filtre.</p>

  <div id="empty" class="empty" hidden>
    <div class="empty-coti" set:html={mascotSvg('think', 110)} />
    <h2>Ton classeur est vide</h2>
    <p class="muted">Scanne ta première carte : le scanner la reconnaît et te propose de l'ajouter ici. Tu peux aussi en gagner une chaque jour dans le Défi.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" id="go-scan" href="#">Scanner une carte</a>
  </div>

  <section class="panel backup">
    <div>
      <h2>Sauvegarde</h2>
      <p class="muted small">Pour tout sauvegarder d'un coup (classeur, favoris, Défi, quêtes, succès), utilise la <a href="../compte/#sauvegarde">sauvegarde complète de l'onglet Compte</a>. Ici, tu peux exporter seulement ta collection. Une collection se restaure sur un classeur vide (par exemple sur un nouvel appareil). Les cartes rangées restent dans ton classeur : on ne peut ni les supprimer, ni les dupliquer, ni changer leur état.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="backup-actions">
      <button class="btn" id="export" type="button">Exporter</button>
      <label class="btn" for="import-file">Restaurer une sauvegarde</label>
      <input id="import-file" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" class="sr-only" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <p class="notice">Estimation approximative : cote Near Mint (Cardmarket) multipliée par un coefficient d'état. Elle ne tient pas compte de l'authenticité ni d'une expertise.</p>


  <template id="slot-tpl">
    <article class="slot">
      <a class="slot-card" data-slot="link">
        <span class="qty-badge" data-slot="qty-badge"></span>
        <span class="finish-badge" data-slot="finish-badge" hidden>Reverse</span>
        <span class="value-tag" data-slot="value"></span>
      </a>
      <div class="slot-info">
        <span class="slot-name" data-slot="name"></span>
        <span class="slot-sub" data-slot="sub"></span>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-controls">
        <div class="stepper" title="Une carte rangée reste dans ton classeur. Pour un exemplaire de plus, scanne-la.">
          <span class="qty-x">×</span><span data-slot="qty"></span>
        </div>
        <span class="cond-chip" data-slot="cond" title="État choisi à l'ajout : il ne change plus ensuite."></span>
      </div>
    </article>
  </template>

  <script>
    import { getItems, exportJson, importJson, storageAvailable, type Item } from '../lib/collection';
    import { conditionFactor, conditionLabel } from '../lib/condition';
    import { getCard, priceFor, formatPrice, type Card, type PriceInfo } from '../lib/tcgdex';
    import { rarityTier, USD_TO_EUR, type Tier } from '../lib/rarity';
    import { holoCard, el, toast, url } from '../lib/ui';
    import { loadTotals, computeRows, cachedTotals, type SetRow } from '../lib/sets';

    const $ = <T extends HTMLElement>(id: string) => document.getElementById(id) as T;
    const binder = $('binder');
    const tpl = $<HTMLTemplateElement>('slot-tpl');
    const sortSel = $<HTMLSelectElement>('sort');
    const findIn = $<HTMLInputElement>('find');
    const chips = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-filter]')];
    let lastShown: Item[] = [];
    let view: 'grid' | 'book' = 'grid';
    try { if (localStorage.getItem('holocote.view.v1') === 'book') view = 'book'; } catch { /* rien */ }
    let spread = 0; // index de la double page affichée
    $<HTMLAnchorElement>('go-scan').href = url('/scanner/');
    if (!storageAvailable()) $('storage-warning').hidden = false;

    const cards = new Map<string, Card | null>(); // détails chargés depuis TCGdex
    const ckey = (i: Pick<Item, 'cardId' | 'lang'>) => `${i.lang}:${i.cardId}`;
    let filter: 'all' | 'rare' | 'ultra' | 'secret' = 'all';

    const TIER_RANK: Record<Tier, number> = { common: 0, uncommon: 1, rare: 2, ultra: 3, secret: 4 };

    function priceOf(it: Item): PriceInfo | null | undefined {
      const c = cards.get(ckey(it));
      if (c === undefined) return undefined;
      return c ? priceFor(c, it.finish) : null;
    }
    const lineValue = (it: Item, p: PriceInfo) => p.value * conditionFactor(it.condition) * it.quantity;
    const unitEur = (it: Item) => {
      const p = priceOf(it);
      return p ? (p.unit === 'EUR' ? p.value : p.value * USD_TO_EUR) * conditionFactor(it.condition) : -1;
    };

    function render() {
      const items = getItems();
      $('empty').hidden = items.length > 0;
      $('toolbar').hidden = items.length === 0;
      renderStats(items);

      const q = findIn.value.trim().toLowerCase();
      let shown = items.filter((it) => {
        const t = TIER_RANK[rarityTier(it.rarity)];
        if (filter === 'rare' && t < 2) return false;
        if (filter === 'ultra' && t < 3) return false;
        if (filter === 'secret' && t < 4) return false;
        return !q || it.name.toLowerCase().includes(q) || (it.setName ?? '').toLowerCase().includes(q);
      });
      const sort = sortSel.value;
      shown = shown.sort((a, b) =>
        sort === 'name' ? a.name.localeCompare(b.name, 'fr')
        : sort === 'recent' ? b.addedAt - a.addedAt
        : sort === 'rarity' ? TIER_RANK[rarityTier(b.rarity)] - TIER_RANK[rarityTier(a.rarity)] || unitEur(b) - unitEur(a)
        : unitEur(b) - unitEur(a),
      );
      $('no-match').hidden = !(items.length && !shown.length);
      lastShown = shown;
      if (view === 'book') { binder.replaceChildren(); binder.hidden = true; renderBook(); }
      else { binder.hidden = false; $('book').hidden = true; binder.replaceChildren(...shown.map(slotFor)); }
    }

    function slotFor(it: Item): DocumentFragment {
      const node = tpl.content.cloneNode(true) as DocumentFragment;
      const s = (n: string) => node.querySelector(`[data-slot="${n}"]`) as HTMLElement;
      const tier = rarityTier(it.rarity);
      (node.querySelector('.slot') as HTMLElement).dataset.tier = tier;
      const link = s('link') as HTMLAnchorElement;
      link.href = url(`/carte/?id=${encodeURIComponent(it.cardId)}&lang=${it.lang}`);
      link.prepend(holoCard(it.image, it.name));
      s('qty-badge').textContent = `×${it.quantity}`;
      s('qty-badge').hidden = it.quantity < 2;
      s('finish-badge').hidden = it.finish !== 'reverse';
      const p = priceOf(it);
      s('value').textContent = p === undefined ? '…' : p ? formatPrice(lineValue(it, p), p.unit) : 'Sans cote';
      s('name').textContent = it.name;
      s('sub').textContent = [it.setName, it.lang.toUpperCase()].filter(Boolean).join(' · ');
      s('qty').textContent = String(it.quantity);

      s('cond').textContent = `${it.condition} · ${conditionLabel(it.condition)}`;
      return node;
    }

    function renderStats(items: Item[]) {
      const sums: Record<string, number> = {};
      let count = 0, missing = 0, pending = 0, rares = 0;
      let gem: { it: Item; p: PriceInfo; eur: number } | null = null;
      for (const it of items) {
        count += it.quantity;
        if (TIER_RANK[rarityTier(it.rarity)] >= 2) rares += it.quantity;
        const p = priceOf(it);
        if (p === undefined) { pending++; continue; }
        if (p === null) { missing += it.quantity; continue; }
        sums[p.unit] = (sums[p.unit] ?? 0) + lineValue(it, p);
        const eur = unitEur(it);
        if (!gem || eur > gem.eur) gem = { it, p, eur };
      }
      const parts = Object.entries(sums).map(([u, v]) => formatPrice(v, u as 'EUR' | 'USD'));
      $('total').textContent = parts.length ? parts.join(' + ') : items.length ? '—' : '0 €';
      $('total-detail').textContent = [pending ? 'calcul en cours…' : '', missing ? `${missing} sans cote` : '', sums.USD ? 'USD : marché américain' : '']
        .filter(Boolean).join(' · ');
      $('count').textContent = String(count);
      $('unique').textContent = String(items.length);
      $('rares').textContent = String(rares);

      const gemEl = $<HTMLAnchorElement>('gem');
      gemEl.hidden = !gem;
      if (gem) {
        gemEl.href = url(`/carte/?id=${encodeURIComponent(gem.it.cardId)}&lang=${gem.it.lang}`);
        $('gem-card').replaceChildren(holoCard(gem.it.image, gem.it.name, 'high'));
        $('gem-name').textContent = gem.it.name;
        $('gem-value').textContent = formatPrice(gem.p.value * conditionFactor(gem.it.condition), gem.p.unit);
      }
    }

    async function loadCards() {
      const todo = [...new Map(getItems().map((i) => [ckey(i), i])).values()].filter((i) => !cards.has(ckey(i)));
      let idx = 0;
      const worker = async () => {
        while (idx < todo.length) {
          const it = todo[idx++];
          cards.set(ckey(it), await getCard(it.cardId, it.lang).catch(() => null));
        }
      };
      await Promise.all(Array.from({ length: 6 }, worker));
      render();
    }

    /* ---------- Classeur en pages ---------- */
    const PER_PAGE = 9;
    const perSpread = () => (window.matchMedia('(min-width: 900px)').matches ? 2 : 1);
    function pocket(it: Item | undefined, n: number): HTMLElement {
      if (!it) return el('div', { class: 'pocket empty', 'aria-hidden': 'true' }, [el('span', {}, [String(n)])]);
      const p = priceOf(it);
      const tier = rarityTier(it.rarity);
      return el('a', { class: `pocket tier-${tier}`, href: url(`/carte/?id=${encodeURIComponent(it.cardId)}&lang=${it.lang}`), title: it.name }, [
        holoCard(it.image, it.name),
        el('span', { class: 'pk-name' }, [it.name]),
        p ? el('span', { class: 'pk-val' }, [formatPrice(lineValue(it, p), p.unit)]) : null,
      ]);
    }
    function renderBook(dir = 0) {
      const book = $('book');
      book.hidden = false;
      const per = perSpread();
      const pages = Math.max(1, Math.ceil(lastShown.length / PER_PAGE));
      const spreads = Math.ceil(pages / per);
      spread = Math.max(0, Math.min(spread, spreads - 1));
      const first = spread * per;
      const pageEls: HTMLElement[] = [];
      for (let k = 0; k < per; k++) {
        const pi = first + k;
        if (pi >= pages && per > 1 && k > 0) { pageEls.push(el('div', { class: 'page blank' }, [el('span', { class: 'pg-n' }, ['Fin du classeur'])])); continue; }
        const cells = Array.from({ length: PER_PAGE }, (_, j) => pocket(lastShown[pi * PER_PAGE + j], pi * PER_PAGE + j + 1));
        pageEls.push(el('div', { class: `page ${k === 0 ? 'left' : 'right'}` }, [el('div', { class: 'pg-grid' }, cells), el('span', { class: 'pg-n' }, [`Page ${pi + 1}`])]));
      }
      const sp = $('book-spread');
      sp.replaceChildren(...pageEls);
      sp.classList.remove('flip-next', 'flip-prev');
      if (dir) { void sp.offsetWidth; sp.classList.add(dir > 0 ? 'flip-next' : 'flip-prev'); }
      const a = first + 1, b = Math.min(first + per, pages);
      $('book-pg').textContent = a === b ? `Page ${a} sur ${pages}` : `Pages ${a}-${b} sur ${pages}`;
      ($('book-prev') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = spread === 0;
      ($('book-next') as HTMLButtonElement).disabled = spread >= spreads - 1;
    }
    const turn = (d: number) => { const before = spread; spread += d; renderBook(d); if (spread === before) renderBook(); };
    $('book-prev').addEventListener('click', () => turn(-1));
    $('book-next').addEventListener('click', () => turn(1));
    $('book').addEventListener('keydown', (e) => { if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') turn(1); if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') turn(-1); });
    document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
      if (view !== 'book' || (e.target as HTMLElement).closest('input, select, textarea')) return;
      if (e.key === 'ArrowRight') turn(1); else if (e.key === 'ArrowLeft') turn(-1);
    });
    let touchX: number | null = null;
    $('book').addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => { touchX = e.touches[0].clientX; }, { passive: true });
    $('book').addEventListener('touchend', (e) => { if (touchX === null) return; const dx = e.changedTouches[0].clientX - touchX; touchX = null; if (Math.abs(dx) > 50) turn(dx < 0 ? 1 : -1); });
    window.matchMedia('(min-width: 900px)').addEventListener('change', () => { if (view === 'book') renderBook(); });
    const viewBtns = [...document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-view]')];
    const setView = (v: 'grid' | 'book') => {
      view = v;
      viewBtns.forEach((b) => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.view === v)));
      try { localStorage.setItem('holocote.view.v1', v); } catch { /* rien */ }
      render();
    };
    viewBtns.forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => setView(b.dataset.view as 'grid' | 'book')));
    viewBtns.forEach((b) => b.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(b.dataset.view === view)));

    chips.forEach((b) => b.addEventListener('click', () => {
      filter = b.dataset.filter as typeof filter;
      chips.forEach((c) => c.setAttribute('aria-pressed', String(c === b)));
      render();
    }));
    sortSel.addEventListener('change', render);
    findIn.addEventListener('input', render);

    $('export').addEventListener('click', () => {
      const blob = new Blob([exportJson()], { type: 'application/json' });
      const a = el('a', { href: URL.createObjectURL(blob), download: `holocote-collection-${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.json` });
      document.body.append(a);
      a.click();
      setTimeout(() => { URL.revokeObjectURL(a.href); a.remove(); }, 1000);
    });

    const importInput = $<HTMLInputElement>('import-file');
    importInput.addEventListener('change', async () => {
      const f = importInput.files?.[0];
      importInput.value = '';
      if (!f) return;
      if (f.size > 2_000_000) { toast('Fichier trop gros'); return; }
      // Une sauvegarde ne s'ajoute pas à une collection existante : impossible de s'ajouter des cartes sans les scanner.
      if (getItems().length > 0) { toast("Pour restaurer une sauvegarde, ta collection doit être vide : une sauvegarde sert à retrouver ta collection sur un nouvel appareil."); return; }
      try {
        const n = importJson(await f.text(), 'replace');
        toast(`${n} carte${n > 1 ? 's' : ''} restaurée${n > 1 ? 's' : ''}`);
        render();
        loadCards();
      } catch {
        toast("Ce fichier n'est pas une collection HoloCote");
      }
    });


    /* ---------- Objectifs par extension ---------- */
    let showAllSets = false;
    let setLogos = new Map<string, string>();
    const STEPS = [0.1, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1];
    function setRowEl(r: SetRow): HTMLElement {
      const pct = Math.round(r.pct * 100);
      const next = STEPS.find((s) => s > r.pct + 1e-9);
      const need = r.official && next ? Math.ceil(next * r.official) - r.inSet : 0;
      const logo = setLogos.get(r.id);
      return el('li', { class: `sg-row ${r.pct >= 1 ? 'full' : ''}` }, [
        el('span', { class: 'sg-logo', 'aria-hidden': 'true' }, [logo ? el('img', { src: `${logo}.webp`, alt: '', loading: 'lazy', referrerpolicy: 'no-referrer' }) : r.id.toUpperCase()]),
        el('div', { class: 'sg-tx' }, [
          el('div', { class: 'sg-top' }, [
            el('strong', {}, [r.name]),
            el('span', { class: 'sg-n' }, [r.official ? `${r.inSet}/${r.official}` : `${r.owned} carte${r.owned > 1 ? 's' : ''}`, r.extra ? el('small', {}, [` +${r.extra} secrète${r.extra > 1 ? 's' : ''}`]) : null]),
          ]),
          el('span', { class: 'sg-bar', role: 'progressbar', 'aria-valuemin': '0', 'aria-valuemax': '100', 'aria-valuenow': String(pct), 'aria-label': `${r.name} : ${pct} %` }, [el('i', { style: `width:${Math.max(r.pct * 100, r.inSet ? 1.5 : 0)}%` })]),
          el('span', { class: 'muted small' }, [r.pct >= 1 ? 'Extension complète, bravo !' : r.official && next ? `${pct} % · encore ${need} carte${need > 1 ? 's' : ''} pour ${Math.round(next * 100)} %` : r.official ? `${pct} %` : 'Total de la série inconnu']),
        ]),
      ]);
    }
    function renderSets(totals = cachedTotals()) {
      const rows = computeRows(totals);
      $('sets-goal').hidden = rows.length === 0;
      const shown = showAllSets ? rows : rows.slice(0, 6);
      $('sg-list').replaceChildren(...shown.map(setRowEl));
      $('sg-more').hidden = rows.length <= 6;
      $('sg-more').textContent = showAllSets ? 'Réduire' : `Voir mes ${rows.length} extensions`;
    }
    $('sg-more').addEventListener('click', () => { showAllSets = !showAllSets; renderSets(); });
    renderSets();
    if (getItems().length) loadTotals('fr').then(({ totals, logos }) => {
      setLogos = logos;
      renderSets(totals);
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('holocote:progress'));
    }).catch(() => {});
    window.addEventListener('holocote:collection', () => renderSets());

    render();
    loadCards();
  </script>

  <style>
    .sets-goal { margin: 0 0 24px; padding: 20px; border-radius: 22px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); }
    .sg-head h2 { margin: 0 0 4px; }
    .sg-head p { margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .sg-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 10px 18px; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-row) { display: flex; gap: 12px; align-items: center; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-row.full) { border-color: rgba(255, 210, 90, 0.55); box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 210, 90, 0.12); }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-logo) { flex: 0 0 64px; height: 36px; display: grid; place-items: center; font-weight: 800; font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--muted); }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-logo img) { max-width: 64px; max-height: 36px; object-fit: contain; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-tx) { flex: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-top) { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: baseline; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-top) { flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-top strong) { min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-n) { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 800; white-space: nowrap; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-n small) { font-family: var(--font-body); color: var(--gold); font-weight: 700; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-bar) { position: relative; height: 8px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); overflow: hidden; }
    .sg-list :global(.sg-bar i) { position: absolute; inset: 0 auto 0 0; border-radius: 4px; background: var(--holo); }
    #sg-more { margin-top: 12px; border: 0; background: none; padding: 0; color: var(--cyan); cursor: pointer; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; }
    @media (max-width: 720px) { .sets-goal { padding: 16px 12px; } .sg-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
    .hero { display: grid; gap: 28px; grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 20px 0 28px; align-items: center; }
    @media (min-width: 860px) { .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px; } }
